Here L is the lower limit or the lower observation of the mode class.

563
00:57:00,462 --> 00:57:02,820
h is the size of the mode class.

564
00:57:04,622 --> 00:57:07,396
Fm is the frequency of the mode class.

565
00:57:07,790 --> 00:57:11,236
F1 is the frequency of the class proceeding to mode.

