2104
03:31:30,128 --> 03:31:37,924
Here are some key concepts. If the probability or p equals to 0, that means the event will never occur.

2105
03:31:38,208 --> 03:31:41,700
If p is equals to 1, the event will always occur.

2106
03:31:41,968 --> 03:31:50,928
