09:39:13,358 --> 09:39:18,064
We don't want to look at it and be confused by the images or what's going on there with mixed data.

6953
09:39:18,304 --> 09:39:26,944
And the information gain, it is a measure of decrease in entropy after the data set is split, also known as entropy reduction.

6954
09:39:27,424 --> 09:39:29,184
Information gain should be high.

6955
09:39:29,358 --> 09:39:33,504
So we want our information that we get out of the split to be as high as possible.

