And in this we have our visible input layer and we have our hidden layer. The Boltzmann machines are almost always shallow.

11676
16:33:49,710 --> 16:33:57,360
They're usually just two-layer neural nets that make stochastic decisions whether a neuron should be on or off. True, false. Yes, no.

11677
16:33:57,520 --> 16:34:00,640
First layer is the visible layer, and second layer is the hidden layer.

11678
16:34:00,880 --> 16:34:09,600
