16:34:48,288 --> 16:34:52,208
But in these models we're looking at just the Boltzmann restricted layers.

11685
16:34:52,368 --> 16:34:58,208
So this is what causes them to fire. Either they don't or they do. It's a yes or no, true, false, all or nothing.

11686
16:34:58,382 --> 16:35:03,408
It accepts the weighted sum of the inputs, the bias as input to any activation function.

11687
16:35:03,568 --> 16:35:12,448
So whatever activation function is, it needs to have the sum of the weights times the input. So each input, if you remember on that model, and let's just go back to that model real quick.

11688
16:35:12,608 --> 16:35:14,688
And then you always have to add a bias.

