14447
21:14:38,670 --> 21:14:40,640
The math behind this is very simple.

14448
21:14:40,800 --> 21:14:51,520
We take D plus, the shortest distance to the closest positive point, which would be on the men's side, and D minus is the shortest distance to the closest negative point, which is on the women's side.

14449
21:14:51,680 --> 21:14:59,760
The sum of D plus and D minus is called the distance margin, or the distance between the two support vectors that are shown in the dashed lines.

