14911
22:01:27,920 --> 22:01:29,440
need to be put together.

14912
22:01:29,678 --> 22:01:32,880
So that's what k means clustering is all about.

14913
22:01:33,120 --> 22:01:36,640
The term k is basically a number.

14914
