23:25:08,206 --> 23:25:14,052
Now, this gradient descent method is used to minimize the cost function and update the parameters of the learning model.

15686
23:25:14,926 --> 23:25:19,556
The gradient always points in the direction of the steepest increase in the loss function.

15687
23:25:20,110 --> 23:25:27,204
The gradient descent algorithm takes a step in the direction of the negative gradient in order to reduce the loss as quickly as possible.

