16004
23:58:46,734 --> 23:58:48,768
Now let's have a closer look at calculus.

16005
23:58:48,928 --> 23:58:51,728
You have differential calculus and integral calculus.

16006
23:58:51,854 --> 23:58:54,368
Now these help in determining the probability of events.

16007
23:58:54,528 --> 23:58:58,528
For example, in finding the posterior probability in a nave-based model.

