Now all algorithms except linear regression fall under the category of classification, which is used to determine whether a particular data falls into a particular category.

16041
24:01:30,638 --> 24:01:34,448
On the other hand, you have linear regression that falls under regression algorithms.

16042
24:01:34,608 --> 24:01:36,688
