24:50:13,934 --> 24:50:16,868
Next, we talk about the concept of variance.

16569
24:50:17,454 --> 24:50:24,580
So variance of a random variable allows us to know something about the spread of the possible values of the variable.

16570
24:50:25,422 --> 24:50:33,904
So for a discrete random variable x, the variances of x is going to be denoted by using a simple formula that is going to be var

16571
24:50:34,064 --> 24:50:42,180
x equals ex minus m, the whole square where m is basically the expected value of the expectation of x.

16572
24:50:42,574 --> 24:50:48,804
So this is more like a standard deviation of x, which can also be represented by using this formula.

16573
24:50:49,518 --> 24:50:57,764
So the variance does not behave in the same way as expectation when we multiply and add constants to random variables.

16574
24:51:00,046 --> 24:51:05,316
So now there are two different types of variants that we can have a fair understanding on.

16575
24:51:05,838 --> 24:51:10,212
First of all, we have low variance, and then we have high variance.

16576
24:51:11,534 --> 24:51:22,224
So low variance simply means that there is a small variation in the production of the target function, with changes in the trading data set and at the same time,

16577
24:51:22,574 --> 24:51:24,624
high variance as we can see here.

16578
24:51:24,878 --> 24:51:31,940
High variance shows a large variation in prediction of the target function with changes in the trading data set.

16579
24:51:32,302 --> 24:51:37,860
So a model that shows high variance learns a lot and perform well with the trading data set.

16580
24:51:38,254 --> 24:51:41,604
And it does not generalize well with the unseen data set.

16581
24:51:41,902 --> 24:51:50,340
And that's why, as a result, such a model gives good results with training data set, but shows high error rates on the test data set.

16582
24:51:50,894 --> 24:51:57,636
And since the high variance a model learns too much from the data set, it leads to an overfitting of the model.

16583
24:51:58,414 --> 24:52:07,268
