If a line is parallel to x-axis, it is a zero slope.

22149
32:13:07,310 --> 32:13:13,156
On the other hand, if the line is parallel to y-axis, then the slope is undefined.

22150
32:13:14,094 --> 32:13:16,612
Linear equation in point slope form.

22151
32:13:17,358 --> 32:13:22,884
A straight line is represented in point slope form by its slope, and a point on the line.

