22193
32:17:26,062 --> 32:17:31,556
For substitution we start by putting one of the equations in the form of variable equals to.

22194
32:17:33,230 --> 32:17:37,508
We then substitute that variable in the other equation in its place.

22195
32:17:38,254 --> 32:17:40,228
Take the other equation to solve.

22196
32:17:41,166 --> 32:17:47,172
If there are more than two variables involved, we repeat the process from steps 1 through 3.

22197
32:17:49,966 --> 32:17:51,588
