22212
32:19:26,382 --> 32:19:32,420
In this case, we start by multiplying an equation by a constant anything other than 0.

22213
32:19:33,646 --> 32:19:37,444
We then add or subtract an equation onto the other equation.

22214
32:19:38,990 --> 32:19:46,628
