22220
32:20:11,726 --> 32:20:15,268
On solving this, we end up getting x equals to 3.

22221
32:20:16,558 --> 32:20:25,412
Now using these steps of substitution, we put the value of x in the original second equation, that is x plus y equals to 8,

22222
32:20:27,118 --> 32:20:30,084
and achieve a value of y equals to 5.

22223
32:20:31,470 --> 32:20:36,292
Hence the answer remains x equals to 3 and y equals to 5.

22224
32:20:38,574 --> 32:20:41,604
We can verify the solution by using the graph.

22225
32:20:42,766 --> 32:20:50,020
Here again, the blue line represents the point at which 3x plus 2y equals to 19 is true,

22226
32:20:50,766 --> 32:20:56,036
