22227
32:20:57,326 --> 32:21:01,284
The solution is found at the point where x equals to three

22228
32:21:02,574 --> 32:21:04,452
and y equals to five.

22229
32:21:05,678 --> 32:21:08,644
This is the point where both lines intersect.

