Let's take a look at entropy from the mathematical side.

22715
33:04:15,534 --> 33:04:25,488
In this case, we're going to denote entropy as I of p of and n, where p is the probability that you're going to play a game of golf,

22716
33:04:25,568 --> 33:04:28,688
and n is the probability where you're not going to play the game of golf.

22717
33:04:28,910 --> 33:04:33,648
Now you don't really have to memorize these formulas. There's a few of them out there depending on what you're working with.

