30699
45:26:18,158 --> 45:26:25,408
So if k is equal to 2, there will be two clusters, if k is equal to 3, 3 clusters, and so on and so forth. That's what the k stands for.

30700
45:26:25,614 --> 45:26:32,580
And of course, there is a way of finding out what is the best or optimum value of k for a given data. We will look at that.

